        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vsxwWIAsHLHdIllqDkbI6m1XpVE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-9082-broccoli-casserole-with-rice-VAT-step-03-b84eb1be09d9431da3a4af94cbae3a44.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9082/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine broccoli, rice, onion, soup, and cheese sauce together: season with salt and pepper. Transfer mixture into a 9x13-inch casserole dish.",
